      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a helpful distinction. To get more granular for my review, can you expand on the specifics of that \"integrated view\"? Specifically, in studies that link ancestry to these neurobiological markers—like the serotonergic or oxytocin systems—are there particular ancestral groups that are consistently identified with higher or lower propensities for these traits in the literature? I'm looking for the specific correlations that appear most frequently in the data across different racial or ethnic clusters.",
      "source": "evaluator"
